  "briefing": [
    "Two catwalks, a cutting beam down the middle of each, a sentry behind it. Nothing with a pulse gets across.",
    "The plate slams both gates. A recording that walks into a shut gate does not stop: it carries on without a body, and beams ignore what is not there.",
    "No body, no hands. It is you again when its spark catches up, and a spark needs an open door.",
    "New on the deck: REPEAT. A tape that runs out can start over instead of standing still."
  ],
  "hints": {
    "1": "The take keeps recording after you die. What a ghost did only counts if a later tape keeps that self in one piece.",
